data: {"id": "69e03c0ee0944fef-thinking-parallel_evidence-210", "run_id": "69e03c0ee0944fef", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 首轮可观测性结果审查\n\n- **Metrics**: `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (reason=\"ContainerCreating\"), `kube_pod_status_phase=1` (phase=\"Pending\"), restarts=0。确认 Pod 仍处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 阶段，未进入 Running。\n- **Logging**: `empty` — Pod 尚未启动容器，无应用日志是预期结果。\n- **Tracing**: `empty` — `pod_ip is empty`，因为 Pod 未调度/未分配 IP，DeepFlow flow 无法查询，也是预期结果。\n\n**下一步**: Metrics 确认了状态，但未能揭示 \"为什么 ContainerCreating\"。需要执行核心计划：`kubectl_describe` 获取 Events 原文（FailedMount? FailedCreatePodSandBox?），以及 `kubectl_get_ya", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788783121387, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

