data: {"id": "69e03c0ee0944fef-thinking-parallel_evidence-212", "run_id": "69e03c0ee0944fef", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "TodoWrite", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=585 lines=9\nInvestigation plan updated with 5 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 0 completed, 1 in progress, 4 pending\n[ ] [step-2-yaml] kubectl_get_yaml 获", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788783121473, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_1e6a65c7f54f48cf943553e6", "tool_sequence": 1, "semantic_success": true, "result": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=585 lines=9\nInvestigation plan updated with 5 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 0 completed, 1 in progress, 4 pending\n[ ] [step-2-yaml] kubectl_get_yaml 获取 volumes/runtimeClass/nodeName 配置\n[ ] [step-3-pvc] kubectl_get_by_kind_in_namespace 查看 PVC/PV 状态 (如果 events 指向 volume)\n[ ] [step-4-topology] query_pod_topology 获取拓扑关系 (控制器、节点)\n[ ] [step-5-conclude] 综合分析 Events + YAML 判定根因分支\n[~] [step-1-describe] kubectl_describe pod 获取 Events 原文，确认 ContainerCreating 的直接原因 (FailedMount vs FailedCreatePodSandBox)\n**Instructions**: Use TodoWrite tool to update task status as you work.", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/69e03c0ee0944fef-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/69e03c0ee0944fef-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/69e03c0ee0944fef-g1/tools/004-evidence-TodoWrite.summary.txt"}

