data: {"id": "69e03c0ee0944fef-thinking-parallel_evidence-587", "run_id": "69e03c0ee0944fef", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "工具已返回，正在汇总事实。\n\n**事实汇总**:\n1.  **Pod 状态**: `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 仍处于 `Pending` 阶段，Phase 为 `Pending`。\n2.  **根因定位**: `kubectl_describe` Events 明确指出，Multus CNI 在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中找不到名为 `unavailable-network` 的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition (NAD) 资源。\n3.  **NAD 资源验证**: 通过 `kubectl_get_by_kind_in_namespace` 查询 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间，确认确实不存在 `unavailable-network` 这个 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 资源。\n4.  **拓扑确认**: Pod 被调度到 `node2`，Owner 为 ReplicaSet `workload-5dbb5dcd6c`，归属于 Deployment `workload`。Pod 绑", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788783143020, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

